What:		/sys/class/leds/<led>/aura_mode
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Marco Scardovi <scardracs@disroot.org>
Description:	read/write
		ASUS Aura topology mode on hid-asus Dynamic Lighting nodes.
		One of "auto", "unified", or "split". In unified mode only the
		global node accepts effect/direct writes; in split mode the
		keyboard and lightbar nodes are independent and the global
		node returns -EBUSY.
